        "original_id": "520616f3-ee61-5d24-8daa-2f280361afcd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jan Kodeš, Margaret Court, Ion Țiriac\n- Events: 1970 French Open\n- Places: Perth, Western Australia\n- Roles: Christian minister, tennis player\n- Topics: Grand Slam titles, singles titles, men's doubles\n\nFacts:\n- Jan Kodeš and Margaret Court won the singles titles at the 1970 French Open.\n- Ion Țiriac, a former top 10 tennis player, won the men's doubles title at the 1970 French Open, which was his only Grand Slam title.\n- Margaret Court is currently a Christian minister in Perth, Western Australia.",
